2025-08-08 22:53:21 [deepseek-chat] The Vai script is a testament to African ingenuity, blending indigenous tradition with
2025-08-08 22:53:21 [deepseek-chat] functional literacy. While facing challenges from Latin script dominance, it remains a vibrant
2025-08-08 22:53:21 [deepseek-chat] cultural symbol and is gradually adapting to the digital age.
